       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "accordion",
       "settings": {
        "tabs": [
         {
          "_id": "2b3ae97",
          "tab_title": "What age is the Talking Cactus for?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Check the age rating on the box of your Talking Cactus before giving it to your little one. It is a soft toy with a battery inside, so play should always be supervised, and it is not a sleep toy to leave in a cot.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "c5a9a33",
          "tab_title": "How does it charge?",
          "tab_content": "<p>It charges with the USB cable in the box. Plug it into a phone charger or a laptop, and a full charge gives hours of play.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "761319e",
          "tab_title": "Can I turn the volume down?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Yes. The switch underneath the pot has a quieter setting for naps and car trips, and an off setting for when you need some peace.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "c892b58",
          "tab_title": "How long does delivery take?",
          "tab_content": "<p>We deliver across South Africa. Orders placed before 12:00 on a weekday are packed the same day, and most arrive within 2 to 4 working days in the main centres. You'll get a tracking number by email.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "6f211bb",
          "tab_title": "How do I pay?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Pay securely at checkout by card, Instant EFT or the other options shown there. We never see or store your card details.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "13f2107",
          "tab_title": "What if something is wrong with my order?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Message us on WhatsApp or email within 7 days of delivery and we'll sort it out with a replacement or a refund. See our <a href='/faq-delivery/'>Delivery &amp; Returns</a> page for the details.</p>"
         }
        ],
